esmjfold2
Copyright 2026 esmjfold2 contributors

This product is a JAX/Equinox translation of the ESMFold2 protein structure
prediction model. It contains code and architectural designs derived from the
following upstream projects:

==================================================================
Portions ported from the Biohub fork of HuggingFace Transformers
==================================================================

Source: https://github.com/Biohub/transformers
        src/transformers/models/esmfold2/{configuration,modeling}_esmfold2*.py
        src/transformers/models/esmc/{configuration,modeling}_esmc.py
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
Copyright 2026 Biohub. All rights reserved.

The PyTorch architecture (modules, parameter names, forward semantics) of
ESMFold2 and ESMC is the work of Biohub / Chan Zuckerberg Biohub. The
following esmjfold2 source files are derivative translations of their
PyTorch reference into JAX/Equinox:

  src/esmjfold2/model.py             ← ESMFold2Model
  src/esmjfold2/esmc.py              ← ESMCModel + transformer blocks
  src/esmjfold2/confidence.py        ← ConfidenceHead
  src/esmjfold2/diffusion.py         ← DiffusionStructureHead + sampler
  src/esmjfold2/attention.py         ← AttentionPairBias + DiffusionTransformer
  src/esmjfold2/triangle.py          ← TriangleMultiplicativeUpdate, OPM, MSAPairWeightedAveraging
  src/esmjfold2/trunk.py             ← FoldingTrunk, PairUpdateBlock, Transition
  src/esmjfold2/inputs.py            ← InputsEmbedder, RelPos, RowAttentionPooling
  src/esmjfold2/swa.py               ← SWA atom attention + 3D RoPE
  src/esmjfold2/atom_encoder.py      ← ESMFold2AtomEncoder/Decoder
  src/esmjfold2/msa.py               ← MSAEncoder
  src/esmjfold2/adaln.py             ← AdaptiveLayerNorm + transition blocks
  src/esmjfold2/swiglu.py            ← SwiGLU variants
  src/esmjfold2/language_model.py    ← LanguageModelShim, SingleToPair
  src/esmjfold2/primitives.py        ← Linear / LayerNorm / etc. matching state-dict layout

Changes vs the upstream reference:
  * Functional / pytree style replacing nn.Module mutable state
  * Refinement loop hoisted into jax.lax.fori_loop (was a Python for-loop)
  * Transformer / atom stacks hoisted into jax.lax.scan (was nn.ModuleList)
  * Karras schedule truncation moved to numpy at trace time (was torch boolean
    indexing producing dynamic shapes)
  * LM-feature wrapper (compute_lm_hidden_states) reimplemented in numpy to
    avoid the dynamic-shape torch.unique / BOS/EOS insertion that isn't
    jax.jit-compatible
  * Triton / flash-attn / cuequivariance / transformer-engine fused kernel
    paths replaced with reference JAX implementations
  * Several upstream indexing bugs identified during parity testing have
    been fixed in this port (rel_pos i/j flip, SingleToPair diff term i/j
    flip, Karras schedule cap clipping in place rather than filter+prepend)

