Portions ported from biohub/esm
==================================================================

Source: https://github.com/Biohub/esm
        esm/models/esmfold2/{output,prepare_input,processor,constants}.py
        esm/models/esmfold2/protein_utils.py (via transformers fork)
License: MIT License
Copyright 2026 Chan Zuckerberg Biohub, Inc.

The structure-output path is a near-direct numpy port:

  src/esmjfold2/structure_output.py  ← build_molecular_complex_from_features

This module also calls into MolecularComplex.to_mmcif() / .to_pdb() at
runtime (no source ported, just a runtime dependency).

